WEBVTT

00:00:28.913 --> 00:00:31.079
dingy, overcrowded clinic

00:00:31.079 --> 00:00:33.371
just to get a minute with me,

00:00:33.371 --> 00:00:35.912
a harried, overworked resident doctor,

00:00:35.912 --> 00:00:38.496
meant that she never came back,

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:41.412
only to die in labor months later.

00:00:41.996 --> 00:00:44.329
I was wracked with guilt.

00:00:44.871 --> 00:00:48.287
If only I had counseled her
about the danger signs,

00:00:48.329 --> 00:00:50.871
why she needed to access regular care.

00:00:51.537 --> 00:00:54.412
Would she and her child have survived?

00:00:54.412 --> 00:00:56.871
She did not die
due to a terminal condition.

00:00:56.912 --> 00:00:59.287
She died because of underlying anemia,

00:00:59.329 --> 00:01:02.079
an easily treatable,
preventable condition.